 "floorplan_note": "fus_hub (DIE f4c_t9p3 reserve 432 x 432 on the strip centre line; this tile 345.6 x 345.6 = 8 x 43.2 fits inside it): W face = quadrants 0 (SW) / 1 (NW) up+down (888 pins on 345.6 um, 2.6/um), E face = quadrants 2 (SE) / 3 (NE) (888, 2.6/um), N = job/control/straps (~255), S none. Macros on the 43.2 lattice: 4 x 128x256 (t4a/t4b/t5 pad data rings + scb) in a 2 x 2 block at x 43.2 / 172.8, y 43.2 / 172.8 (channels 34.8 / 88.6 um), 3 x 32x64 control rings at y 259.2 (69 um from N); >= 43.2 um from the W face and 78 um from E; std cells around (one band). Outline from estimated std ~35k um2 (19-adder padded heap + 3 tree adds + divc/rsqrt + ~6k flops) + 17.2k um2 macros at util ~0.45; the gate's synthesis area re-sizes it.",
